44:
45:Definitions (`scripts/qa/profile-recursion.py`, `prover.md` table 3): d = domain-proportional share; m = commitment MSM share; q = quotient and NTT share (phases 13, 14, 22, 24); m or q = the union of the m and q intervals (the two overlap); U = average cores = process CPU of the proof root / its wall.
