190:## 3. S>1 steps per leaf
191:
192:**Growth.** Leaf rows ≈ S × rows(one universal step) + (S-1) × lane equalities + two
193:digests (`design.md §2.3`). So k_leaf = k_U + ⌈log2 S⌉, prove time ≈ S × t_step, RSS ≈
