codex
The contract’s “one run” claim needs qualification. The source rejects duplicate statement hashes; it does not cap the set at one entry. The Lean theorem supports at most one valid halted statement only under its soundness and initialization premises. The node-row counts are comparable, but they do not show that a universal leaf must widen the circuit or that k=21 must exceed 48 GB.
