ecute-spec` skills; the lean4 plugin at `~/Projects/workflowskills/plugins/lean4-skills/plugins/lean4` (draft, then autoprove with stop budgets, then review; `check_axioms_inline.sh`; the `sorry-filler-deep`, `proof-repair` and `axiom-eliminator` agents). A council review (skill `council`, cross-family lanes) of this design plus the F20/F21 results (task 2.14) precedes the implementation of 2.3, 4.2 and 5.7. Out of scope for both: the cryptographic step (certificate implies witness) and the accumulator algebra, which stay SRC-005/006 test obligations.
